摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek API quota blood-bar widget for the DSH web GUI: remaining balance vs month-opening, today/month spend, session cost. Draggable & collapsible.","id":"gh:1334863774","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-deepseek-quota-bar","slug":"jiangli07/dsh-deepseek-quota-bar","topics":["balance","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","plugin","quota","usage"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek API quota blood-bar widget for the DSH web GUI: remaining balance vs month-opening, today/m"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"onth spend, session cost. Draggable & collapsible."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-deepseek-quota-bar"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"DeepSeek API 额度**血条**插件 for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) web GUI：\n右下角悬浮卡片，血条直观显示「余额 / 本月额度」，并展示今日与本月使用量（官方"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ek API 额度**血条**插件 for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) web GUI：\n右下角悬浮卡片，血条直观显示「余额 / 本月额度」，并展示今日与本月使用量（官方数据优先）。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A floating bottom-right widget for the dsh web GUI: a blood-bar of your remaining\nDeepSeek API balan"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ce vs the month-opening balance, plus today's and this month's\nspend (official platform data when co"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"month-opening balance, plus today's and this month's\nspend (official platform data when configured)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 功能 Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- 🩸 **血条**：剩余比例 = 当前余额 / 月初余额快照（≥50% 绿 / ≥20% 橙 / <20% 红）\n- 📅 **今日/本月使用量**：配置 `DEEPSEEK_PLATFORM_TOK"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"EN` 后为官方精确数据；未配置时自动降级为余额差值估算\n- 💬 **当前对话费用**：按官方价格表对会话日志逐条计价（每条消息按**当时的**政策与峰谷状态），含安装前历史\n- 🕐 **峰谷时段提醒"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"**：时段徽标（工作日 09:00-12:00 / 14:00-18:00 为高峰，**周末全天低谷**）+ 距下次切换倒计时 + 当前模型单价（Flash/Pro 点击切换）\n- 📈 **官方政策自"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"动跟随**：单价由宿主按官方政策时间表（含 2026-08-17 峰谷、08-23 周末低谷、09-10 flash 降价）实时计算，价格调整无需更新插件\n- ⚙️ **可调透明度**：设置按钮 + "},{"id":"p6s5","text":"滑块（0-100%），背景不透明度可调并持久化\n- 🖱️ **可拖动**：按住卡片任意位置拖动，位置持久化（localStorage）\n- 📉 **可折叠**：一键折叠为只显示血条的迷你卡，再点展开\n"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"- 🌗 跟随浅色/深色主题\n- ⏱️ 余额每 60s 自动刷新，支持手动刷新"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 安装 Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"安装后重启 `dsh web`，打开页面强刷（Ctrl+Shift+R），右下角出现卡片。"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 配置 Configuration"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| 凭证 | 必需 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` | ✅ | 与 harness 同一个 Key（设置 → 模型 页面填写） |\n| `DEEPSEEK_PLATFORM_TOKEN` | 可选 | plat"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"form.deepseek.com 的 `userToken`：F12 → Console → 执行 `JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('userToken')).va"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"lue`，把值写入 `~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml` |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"凭证是热读取的：配置后无需重启，下一次刷新即生效。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 工作原理 How it works"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **余额**：`GET https://api.deepseek.com/user/balance`\n- **今日/本月（官方）**：`GET https://platform.deepseek."},{"id":"p15s2","text":"com/api/v0/usage/cost?month=&year=`（与平台控制台同源）\n- **今日/本月（估算兜底）**：月初/当日期初余额快照差值，状态持久化于 `~/.dsh/storage"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"s/deepseek-quota-bar.json`\n- **血条分母**：本月 1 号首次观测到的余额快照；月中新装时用「当前余额 + 本月官方消耗」反推\n- **对话费用**：订阅 `sessio"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"n/event` 实时计价 + 持久化日志全量回放（含重启前历史）"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 开发 Development"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"注意：修改 `lib/client.js` 后需重启 `dsh web`（bundle 引导哈希重新生成）再强刷页面。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 许可 License"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"MIT。Fork 自 yingjunnan/dsh-deepseek-quota（MIT）；\n定价引擎参考 dsh-web-billing（MIT）。"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
